Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:04.16,main,Hado,0,0,0,,So you're Corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:11.46,main,Warrior A,0,0,0,,Sir Hado, let us take Corpse out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:13.45,main,Hado,0,0,0,,That's fine. Have at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:14.06,main,Warrior A,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.33,main,Warrior B,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.24,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,It's like they're not even moving...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:22.82,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's the difference in your stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:24.84,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can deal with them using Ruinous Strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:40.47,main,Warrior E,0,0,0,,Spare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.16,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Wait! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:47.65,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Damn it... you think you \Ncan make a fool of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:51.76,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You're just a monster! \NYou won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:01:00.41,main,Hado,0,0,0,,How is trash like you this powerful?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.13,0:01:02.29,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:07.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't owe you an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:10.45,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Don't... don't get mouthy with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:12.84,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You think you'll get away with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:17.01,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Do you realize who you're dealing with?! \NI'm the second son of the Vlerick family...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:20.42,main,Hado,0,0,0,,The holy knight Hado Vlerick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:26.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then why don't you show me \Nthe holy knight powers you're so proud of?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:02.04,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400\blur1)\pos(471.282,285)}To Galia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.47,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Holy Sword Technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:08.29,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(164.917,86.619)}[Stats]
