Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:08.29,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\fs15\pos(444.209,285.569)}Holy Sword Technique,\NStrength Boost (High)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:09.91,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The special skill you need \Nto become a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.55,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Why'd someone like him end up with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:15.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed, can you shatter a holy sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:21.65,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There is no chance some orichalcum-cut \Nartificial holy sword has the edge on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:23.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Strike as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:29.43,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Idiot. You'd actually face down \Nmy sword at this range...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:33.53,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You really are intellectually bankrupt trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.99,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Grand Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:39.80,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Let the holy light purify you \Nuntil nothing's left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That takes way too long to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:53.18,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Impossible... this is a holy sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Here's the rest of your precious holy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:00.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:07.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Don't run. I thought you were a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:11.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:15.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You really are a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:20.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,On your feet! I think you need \Nto be taught a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:23.62,main,Fate,0,0,0,,"Defiant dogs need strict discipline," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:26.83,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:46.53,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Please... just stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:49.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The nerve you have to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:52.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,After how you treated people like insects...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:57.83,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And now Lady Roxy is heading into danger \Nbecause of filth like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:02.74,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Please... spare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:09.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What was your response when I said that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Bloody Ptarmigan, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:15.85,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I'll be taking some of your stats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:45.99,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You didn't finish me off... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:49.12,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.95,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I have questions first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:55.17,main,Hado,0,0,0,,About Roxy Hart...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:57.36,main,Hado,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:02.78,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:11.93,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,If my life can save even \Na single citizen of this kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:14.13,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Then I will gladly head to Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:21.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,She would say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:27.16,main,Hado,0,0,0,,I'll... get Roxy's Galia \Nexpedition canceled...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:31.08,main,Hado,0,0,0,,J-Just... spare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:35.70,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Don't... don't do something stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.50,main,Hado,0,0,0,,like getting revenge for her sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:39.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}my {\i0}revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:56.46,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.82,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Increasing stats.
