Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.73,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Skill Holy Sword Technique has been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:05.70,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you're a holy knight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:08.21,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The capital would never accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:09.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:19.84,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,So, how about this? Right now, \Nyou can access my second level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:25.05,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Do it. The idea of his stats being \Ninside me makes me want to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:28.23,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I bet. Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.43,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This is my second level:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.90,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,a great scythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:42.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The curse embedded in the blade \Ncan cut through even the ephemeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:46.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It can cut through anything...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:51.21,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I wish it could cut short \NLady Roxy's trip to Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:16.77,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Everyone, don't look so forlorn. \NThree years will be over before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:20.23,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Look after things while I'm gone, Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:23.73,main,Haru,0,0,0,,As head of the Hart family, \Nplease serve with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:26.25,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.69,main,Minerva,0,0,0,,Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:32.47,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:35.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:41.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.06,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.42,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes. Please, look after yourself, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.03,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm heading off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:11.38,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy left a letter \Nof recommendation for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:14.31,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Yes. If you were employed \Nin a lord's manor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:16.91,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,you'd be out of reach for the Vlericks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:20.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,She was worried about me \Nuntil the very end...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.62,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:23.96,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm going to make my way \Nas a warrior from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you've made up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:30.53,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:34.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If I can't stop Lady Roxy from going \Nto Galia, I can at least support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.43,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.40,main,Minerva,0,0,0,,Come back whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:45.39,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,What you've earned up to today, \Nalong with some severance pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:47.06,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,This seems like a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:49.65,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,Never forget the pride that comes \Nfrom serving the Hart family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:52.31,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,Good luck, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.36,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:56.28,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Until we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.31,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And in order for that to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.60,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I need to head to Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:13.92,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,With my power... I'll protect Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:21.32,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Things are shaping up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:29.02,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I have taken over the post \Nheld by my father, Mason Hart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:31.49,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Heading towards the border,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:35.78,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,in order to fell the Divine Dragon that \Nhas awoken, after a millennium of silence,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:40.22,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,so that I may defend the royal capital, \NSeifort, and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.40,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,And I will need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.88,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.88,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Miria, you're joining, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:56.92,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Of course I am! Wherever you go, \NI'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.86,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,You volunteered too, missy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:00.31,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:02.65,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Huh? "Missy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:05.47,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. The name's Mugan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.45,main,Miria,0,0,0,,I'm Miria.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:08.52,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Miria, huh? It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.07,main,Miria,0,0,0,,I know your type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:13.71,main,Miria,0,0,0,,People excited at the chance to see the living\Nnatural disaster that is a Divine Dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:18.33,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Reckless oddballs looking for \Na chance to test their mettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.98,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Can't deny that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.98,0:11:24.71,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Most warriors relish the chance to see just \Nhow far their strength can take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.67,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Great, an idiot warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:29.25,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Miria, that's going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:33.07,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Yay! I got scolded by Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:36.99,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,I volunteered because of Sir Mason, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:40.94,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,I marched under his orders, once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:44.89,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,And as presumptuous as it may be, \NI'd like to avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.59,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.59,0:11:52.11,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But, wouldn't your family \Noppose a trip to Galia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:56.82,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,My daughter, Raine, actually \Nasked me for some Galian relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:00.78,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Galian... relics?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:05.54,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,I come from a long line of scholars \Nwho do research. I'm the only warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.75,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing! Apart from you, Mugan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:10.92,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Just had to throw that in there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:15.63,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I feel like, with the two of you, \Nthis trip may work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:17.09,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.55,main,Both,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.75,0:12:23.08,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,Raine? Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.09,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,You know the lich called Corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:30.63,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,the monster that everyone's \Nbeen talking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.27,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,These are the goblins it's been slaying...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:37.75,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,Look here. These aren't \Nnormal arrow wounds, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:41.70,main,Raine,0,0,0,,That is rather fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:50.21,main,Raine,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.29,main,Raine,0,0,0,,I think this is it. Magic arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:57.19,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,Magic arrows? And that's different \Nfrom Fireball magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:01.14,main,Raine,0,0,0,,It's an ability housed in the black sword, \None of the Weapons of Mortal Sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.70,main,Raine,0,0,0,,The Weapons of Mortal Sin\Nare made of a material
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:05.10,main,Raine,0,0,0,,that can manipulate magic \Npower at a high level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.32,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,The Weapons of Mortal Sin? What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.43,main,Raine,0,0,0,,Not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:14.23,main,Raine,0,0,0,,But if they can control magic power, they'd \Nexpand the possibility spectrum for skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:17.44,main,Raine,0,0,0,,I'd like to see that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:21.75,main,Raine,0,0,0,,One of these Weapons of Mortal Sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:30.54,main,Driver B,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, we're nearly at Tetra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:39.20,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The hub for shipping headed \Ntowards the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:44.57,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A city of merchants, where the best \Ngoods in the south are gathered...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:46.28,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Tetra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:51.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It hasn't changed much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:53.96,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What, you've been here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:56.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah. Five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:02.21,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I just passed through \Non the way to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:03.43,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:06.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:09.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is this carriage headed for Galia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:13.87,main,Driver A,0,0,0,,Not today, it's not. If I headed out now, \NI'd get attacked by monsters in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:15.83,main,Driver A,0,0,0,,Come by again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:16.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.26,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:22.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You wanna run off after Roxy, \Nbut you're stuck here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:22.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.27,main,Driver A,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:27.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, just talking to myself! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:32.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I say you grab something to eat \Nand gather intel for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:33.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.84,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,After that comes shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:40.12,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If this is a big trade town, there might \Nbe a scabbard worthy of me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Are you going on about that, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:43.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:46.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I mean, you've got the Holy \NSword Technique skill now, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:48.94,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That means the scabbard \Nneeds to live up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:51.11,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Maybe something decorated with orichalcum...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:53.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,No, wait, magic crystals would be good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.85,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I've got that severance pay \Nfrom Miss Haru...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.99,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I may as well enjoy some meat today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:04.76,main,Set,0,0,0,,Please, my village needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.76,main,Set,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, it could...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:11.86,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,You think this chump change \Nis enough to get us to hunt monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:13.93,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,And you're begging for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.93,0:15:17.40,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,You want our help, then you oughta \Nshow how much it means to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:18.61,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:20.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.80,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:25.32,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:28.96,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Fine! Fine, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:31.45,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Please, let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:33.95,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.39,main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:36.95,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:39.17,main,Set,0,0,0,,You saved me. Thank y—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:41.63,top,Fate,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:43.53,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:55.51,flashback,Set,0,0,0,,All you do is growl with your stomach, \Nyou good-for-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:56.74,flashback,Friend A,0,0,0,,Good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.06,flashback,Friend B,0,0,0,,Good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:00.65,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Stop! Cut it out, Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:00.65,flashbacktop,Friends,0,0,0,,Good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:05.32,flashback,Man,0,0,0,,Monsters! Monsters are attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:06.89,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:22.39,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,You've gotten used to handling herbs, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:25.70,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Only because you get hurt all the time, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:26.80,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.22,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.69,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,Man, that's bitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.32,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:42.89,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:48.40,flashback,Villager A,0,0,0,,Dean had the Spear Technique skill, \Nso the village chief kept him around, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:52.40,flashback,Villager B,0,0,0,,Who's gonna look after this extra mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:00.95,flashback,Village Chief,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you worthless garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.50,flashback,Villager,0,0,0,,Go on, good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:11.43,flashback,Villagers,0,0,0,,Get out! Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:19.63,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate, please! I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:21.64,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:26.48,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,This is Set, the son \Nof the village chief who exiled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:30.57,main,Set,0,0,0,,I realize how self-centered this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:34.99,main,Set,0,0,0,,But... you're a warrior now, \Nand I need that strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.73,0:17:44.04,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Come on, this works out nicely, Fate. \NYou need to sate Gluttony anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:46.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'll handle your monster problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.37,main,Set,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.98,main,Set,0,0,0,,What a relief. I wasn't sure you'd accept...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:55.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:59.41,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'd be lying if I said \NI didn't still resent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:03.69,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But that village... I have \Nmemories of my father there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:07.93,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,For pity's sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:11.99,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,You actually brought the garbage \Nthat we exiled back with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:14.20,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this, Set?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:19.66,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate's strong! I saw him defeat \Nsome warriors with my very own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:24.31,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,This is pathetic! You can't even \Nhire some warriors properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:27.88,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone, \NI'll find us some warriors tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.10,main,Villager A,0,0,0,,But if the monsters attack first...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:33.68,main,Villager B,0,0,0,,There's been cries from \Na nearby forest since yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:36.09,main,Villager A,0,0,0,,I don't know if we can last \Nuntil the warriors arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:40.56,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,Then we'll use him as a sacrifice \Nto buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.77,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate! Please, just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:45.04,main,Set,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:52.15,main,Set,0,0,0,,I apologize for earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:55.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:19:02.33,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I've been wondering, where's \Nyour wife? I haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Did the monsters get her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:09.54,main,Set,0,0,0,,Yeah... The village is still as poor as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.40,main,Set,0,0,0,,The village chief has absolute authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:18.34,main,Set,0,0,0,,and I... I used to think my old man \Nwas always right, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.52,main,Set,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:26.38,main,Set,0,0,0,,Since my daughter was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.69,main,Set,0,0,0,,I realized I needed to get \Nmy act together, for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:33.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You've really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.33,main,Set,0,0,0,,All thanks to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:45.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Set, tell me about these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.37,main,Set,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:52.42,main,Set,0,0,0,,They first showed up about a month ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:55.97,main,Set,0,0,0,,The witnesses make it sound \Nlike there's more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.44,main,Set,0,0,0,,They can apparently fly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:02.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That sounds like bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:07.33,main,Set,0,0,0,,Yeah... They're nothing like the monsters \Nthe village has had to deal with before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:10.72,main,Set,0,0,0,,That's why we decided to hire some warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:12.32,main,Set,0,0,0,,Without realizing the market price...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:17.96,main,Set,0,0,0,,Still hungry as ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.33,main,Set,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:23.55,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They probably thought things would work out \Nif they could hire some warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.02,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Pretty typical story with small villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:29.99,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,But if these monsters can fly, \Nthat changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:32.22,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You have an idea what \Nwe're dealing with, Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:35.02,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're most likely gargoyles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.45,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,As monsters go, they're on the clever side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:40.60,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They start by doing probing attacks \Nto see how humans react...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.60,0:20:43.68,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And when the time is right, \Nthe entire pack attacks in a swarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:46.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A lot like kobolds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:49.75,main,Set's Daughter,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:53.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh... just to myself, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.07,main,Set's Daughter,0,0,0,,You can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:56.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:01.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You wanna play for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:02.54,main,Set's daughter,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:04.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:06.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:17.51,main,Set,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't have much to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:19.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,No. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:25.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.01,0:21:29.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly... tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:31.69,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate?! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:35.43,main,Set,0,0,0,,How could this happen? \NDid he eat something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.43,0:21:37.83,main,Set's Daughter,0,0,0,,I gave him some candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:38.40,main,Set,0,0,0,,Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:41.36,main,Set's Daughter,0,0,0,,Yeah. Grandpa gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:46.57,main,Set,0,0,0,,Dad... Damn it. Is he serious \Nabout sacrificing Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:50.46,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I get it. Drugged candy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:52.92,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate! You gotta wake up, Fate!
